```

</details>

#### derived struct fields are accessible

- Verify: derived struct fields are accessible
   - Expected: sum equals `255`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: derived struct fields are accessible")
val c = Color(r: 0, g: 255, b: 0)
val sum = c.r + c.g + c.b
expect(sum).to_equal(255)
```

</details>

